{"id": 13, "name": "Clint", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/d/d9/Hero131-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021140929", "cls": ["Marksman", ""], "specialty": ["Finisher", "Burst"], "difficulty": "70", "stats": ["30", "70", "40", "70"], "lanes": ["Gold Lane", ""], "story": "A sharpshooter full of righteousness and justice.", "skills": [{"name": "Double Shot", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_4f34f91aa8c276c6c68c0fb062645591.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 31, "tagname": "Burst", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "After each skill cast, Clint's next Basic Attack within 4s penetrates a line of enemies, dealing 150<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+100% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span>. This damage can trigger attack effects, and the part affected by Physical Attack can Crit."}, {"name": "Quick Draw", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_819bd2b4fce66ea402874193cd70b190.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 8   Mana Cost: 50", "desc": "Clint fires 5 bullets in quick succession in the target direction, each dealing 250<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+85% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to the enemy hit.\n\nThe bullets will spread evenly across enemies in a fan-shaped area. Enemies hit by multiple bullets will take less damage after the first bullet."}, {"name": "Trapping Recoil", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_6813ebabb3e000e3af1935d16faa8f5b.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}, {"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 10   Mana Cost: 80", "desc": "Clint shoots a trap net in the target direction, slightly jumping back while dealing 140<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+30% Total Physical Attack)</